# infortunata
# Ré menor. Forma: abertura ff (lento) -> ostinato pp -> crescendo -> tutti ff -> coda.
# Compasso ternário: harmonia muda a cada 3 beats. Pedal de ré por toda a peça.
tempo 56
tempo 18 140

track str strings_warm
automate cutoff 0 3000 -> 19 2800 -> 22 500 curve exp -> 114 1400 curve log -> 162 4200 curve log -> 226 4000

track cho choir_vox
track mel choir_lead
humanize 6ms 6%
track brass lead_saw
automate cutoff 114 900 -> 162 3500 curve log -> 230 3200
track pulse bass_pulse
track sub subbass
track timp taiko
track gg gong

